#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hello World: Your First Quantum Circuit"
msgstr "Hello World: Circuit Quantum Pertamamu"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"This tutorial was created for doQumentation.\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"Tutorial ini dibuat untuk doQumentation.\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (two entangled qubits) and run it three ways:\n"
msgstr "Buat sebuah [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (dua qubit yang saling terjerat) dan jalankan dengan tiga cara:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Ideal simulation** — perfect results, no account needed\n"
msgstr "**Simulasi ideal** — hasil sempurna, tidak perlu akun\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Noisy simulation** — simulates a real device, no account needed\n"
msgstr "**Simulasi dengan noise** — mensimulasikan perangkat nyata, tidak perlu akun\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Real quantum hardware** — requires a free IBM Quantum account (setup steps below)\n"
msgstr "**Hardware quantum sungguhan** — memerlukan akun IBM Quantum gratis (langkah penyiapan ada di bawah)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit {#build-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Bangun Circuit {#build-the-circuit}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Ideal simulation (no account needed) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-no-account-needed}"
msgstr "Opsi 1: Simulasi ideal (tidak perlu akun) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uses `StatevectorSampler` — a local simulator with perfect, noise-free results.\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan `StatevectorSampler` — simulator lokal dengan hasil sempurna tanpa noise.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Noisy simulation (no account needed) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-no-account-needed}"
msgstr "Opsi 2: Simulasi dengan noise (tidak perlu akun) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Uses `FakeManilaV2` — a local simulator that mimics a real IBM quantum device, including its noise characteristics. The circuit must first be transpiled (adapted) to the device's gate set and qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan `FakeManilaV2` — simulator lokal yang meniru perangkat quantum IBM sungguhan, termasuk karakteristik noise-nya. Circuit harus ditranspilasi terlebih dahulu (disesuaikan) dengan gate set dan konektivitas qubit perangkat tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 3: Real quantum hardware {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr "Opsi 3: Hardware quantum sungguhan {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requires a free IBM Quantum account. To set one up:\n"
msgstr "Memerlukan akun IBM Quantum gratis. Untuk membuatnya:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) — no credit card required for the first 30 days\n"
msgstr "Daftar di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) — tidak perlu kartu kredit untuk 30 hari pertama\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sign in at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and select region **us-east** (required for the free Open Plan)\n"
msgstr "Masuk di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) dan pilih region **us-east** (wajib untuk Open Plan gratis)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an instance (free Open Plan) at [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) if you don't have one yet\n"
msgstr "Buat sebuah instance (Open Plan gratis) di [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) jika kamu belum punya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an API key at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) (or at [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"
msgstr "Buat API key di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) (atau di [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy your **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) from your [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page\n"
msgstr "Salin **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) kamu dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, if you haven't saved your credentials yet in this Binder session, run the cell below. Replace `<your-api-key>` with the API key from step 4, and `<your-crn>` with the CRN from step 5.\n"
msgstr "Lalu, jika kamu belum menyimpan kredensial di sesi Binder ini, jalankan sel di bawah. Ganti `<your-api-key>` dengan API key dari langkah 4, dan `<your-crn>` dengan CRN dari langkah 5.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Jobs on real hardware may take some time depending on queue times. If the cell is still running, you can check your job status and see the results at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"
msgstr "**Catatan:** Job pada hardware sungguhan mungkin membutuhkan waktu tergantung antrean. Jika sel masih berjalan, kamu bisa memeriksa status job dan melihat hasilnya di [quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What next? {#what-next}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya? {#what-next}"

