msgstr "**[Tutorials](https://doqumentation.org/tutorials)** — panduan langkah demi langkah tentang algoritma, mitigasi error, transpilasi, dan lainnya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Guides](https://doqumentation.org/guides)** — reference material on running circuits, primitives, and the Qiskit Runtime\n"
msgstr "**[Guides](https://doqumentation.org/guides)** — materi referensi tentang menjalankan circuit, primitives, dan Qiskit Runtime\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Courses](https://doqumentation.org/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)** — structured learning paths from quantum basics to utility-scale computing\n"
msgstr "**[Courses](https://doqumentation.org/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)** — jalur belajar terstruktur dari dasar quantum hingga komputasi skala utilitas\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Modules](https://doqumentation.org/learning/modules/computer-science)** — deeper conceptual modules in computer science and quantum mechanics\n"
msgstr "**[Modules](https://doqumentation.org/learning/modules/computer-science)** — modul konseptual lebih mendalam tentang ilmu komputer dan mekanika quantum\n"
